    {
      "id": "claim_025ed36d46ee4ae1af06d3897135d219",
      "statement": "The NER labels are natural-language descriptions carrying worked examples rather than short tags, which is how the zero-shot extractor is steered, and the examples interpolate the deployment identity constants.",
