    {
      "id": "claim_b6465637b52a42ceb6e49ae5363ece5a",
      "statement": "Long documents are chunked with a character overlap so an entity spanning a chunk boundary is still detected, and extracted entities are deduplicated by a merge that keeps the longest surface form and absorbs entries that are prefixes of one another.",
